### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /v1/orders/{id}/history — Order status history
### OrderController.getOrderHistory
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@orderBase = {{host}}/v1/orders

###
# @name get-order-history-ok
### [1] Happy path (expect 200, possibly empty list for a new order)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{orderId}}/history

###
# @name get-order-history-not-found
### [2] Non-existent UUID (expect 404)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}/history
